0..78 Comment "//! Loop-carried state. A `while` or a `loop` that names a slot held around it"
79..154 Comment "//! carries the slot through its passes: each pass reads the value the pass"
155..233 Comment "//! before left there, and what follows the loop reads the value the last pass"
234..292 Comment "//! left. The loop is a fold whose accumulator is the slot"
293..371 Comment "//! [Hutton-1999-a_tutorial_on_the_universality_and_expressiveness_of_fold]. A"
372..443 Comment "//! loop may run forever, so each function states `Partial` in its row."
444..447 Comment "//!"
448..464 Comment "//! - see: #1481"
